{"title":"2007 AIME I","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>2007 AIME I</b> was held on March 13, 2007. The first link contains the full set of test problems.  The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems\">2007 AIME I Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AIME I Answer Key\">2007 AIME I Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\"